    "text": [
      "Around Queen Victoria Market half the crowd stayed on average,",
      "against only a third across the rest of the city centre"
    ],
    "subtitle": [
      "Pedestrians counted March to June 2020 as a share of the same months of 2019.",
      "The larger the circle, the more of its crowd remained."
    ],
